[00:11.00]♪
[00:20.50]The city holds its breath tonight
[00:28.00]I traced the road back in my head
[00:33.00]Every light we left behind
[00:38.00]still burning where the map has bled
[00:43.00]You were a window, half awake
[00:47.50]I was the weather moving through
[00:52.00]So tell me how the silence breaks
[00:56.50]when all it ever says is you
[01:00.50]Hold the line, the dark is wide
[01:04.00]We are the afterlight
[01:08.00]Everything we were survives
[01:12.00]folded in the night
[01:16.00]Carry me across the void
[01:20.00]slow as falling snow
[01:24.00]Whatever the morning destroys
[01:28.00]the afterlight will know
[01:33.00]♪
